PlayersHouse_1F_Text_IsntItNiceInHere:: @ 8172429
	.string "ECHO: This room is a safe\n"
	.string "memory. You can rest here,\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MoversPokemonGoSetClock:: @ 8172453
	.string "The DIGIMON are repairing this\n"
	.string "shelter's damaged data.\p"
	.string "Your room is upstairs. Set the\n"
	.string "clock to synchronize your signal\p"
	.string "with this world.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_ArentYouInterestedInRoom:: @ 8172531
	.string "ECHO: Check the room upstairs.\n"
	.string "Its clock will anchor your\p"
	.string "signal.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_GoSetTheClock:: @ 8172574
	.string "ECHO: Set the upstairs clock,\n"
	.string "then we can find BIRCH.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_OhComeQuickly:: @ 81725A3
	.string "MOM: Oh! {PLAYER}, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Quick! Come quickly!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_MaybeDadWillBeOn:: @ 81725C9
	.string "ECHO: Look! A signal from the\n"
	.string "guardian at PETALBURG GYM!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_ItsOverWeMissedHim:: @ 81725FE
	.string "ECHO: The transmission\n"
	.string "collapsed. The guardian may know\p"
	.string "about the DIGITAL KEYS.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_GoIntroduceYourselfNextDoor:: @ 8172644
	.string "BIRCH studies the breach. His\n"
	.string "assistant lives next door.\p"
	.string "Go introduce yourself. They may\n"
	.string "know where to find him.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_SeeYouHoney:: @ 81726D2
	.string "MOM: See you, honey!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_DidYouMeetProfBirch:: @ 81726E7
	.string "MOM: Did you introduce yourself to\n"
	.string "PROF. BIRCH?$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_YouShouldRestABit:: @ 8172717
	.string "MOM: How are you doing, {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "You look a little tired.\p"
	.string "I think you should rest a bit.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_TakeCareHoney:: @ 817276B
	.string "MOM: Take care, honey!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_GotDadsBadgeHeresSomethingFromMom:: @ 8172782
	.string "ECHO: You recovered the BALANCE\n"
	.string "KEY! Your signal is getting\p"
	.string "stronger.\p"
	.string "Take this. A little comfort can\n"
	.string "help you remember home.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_DontPushYourselfTooHard:: @ 81727CD
	.string "Don't push yourself too hard, dear.\n"
	.string "You can always come home.\p"
	.string "Go for it, honey!$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_Machoke1:: @ 817281D
	.string "Gyao, gyao gyaoh...$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_Machoke2:: @ 8172831
	.string "Gwagwah gwah...$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_ReportFromPetalburgGym:: @ 8172841
	.string "INTERVIEWER: ...We brought you this\n"
	.string "report from in front of PETALBURG GYM.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_TheresAMovieOnTV: @ 817288C
	.string "There is a movie on TV.\p"
	.string "Two men are dancing on a big piano\n"
	.string "keyboard.\p"
	.string "Better get going!$"

UnknownString_81728E3: @ 81728E3
	.string "It's the instruction booklet for the\n"
	.string "RUNNING SHOES.\p"
	.string "“Press the B Button to run while\n"
	.string "wearing your RUNNING SHOES.\p"
	.string "“Lace up your RUNNING SHOES and hit\n"
	.string "the road running!”$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_TicketFromBrineyCameForYou:: @ 817298B
	.string "DAD: Hm?\p"
	.string "Hey, it's {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "It's been a while since I saw you,\n"
	.string "but you look...stronger, somehow.\p"
	.string "That's the impression I get.\n"
	.string "But your old man hasn't given up yet!\p"
	.string "Oh, yes, I have something for you.\n"
	.string "This came to you from someone named\l"
	.string "MR. BRINEY.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_PortsInSlateportLilycove:: @ 8172A7D
	.string "DAD: Hm, a TICKET for a ferry?\p"
	.string "If I recall, there are ferry ports in\n"
	.string "SLATEPORT and LILYCOVE.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, if you have ambition as a\n"
	.string "TRAINER, go to the BATTLE TOWER.\p"
	.string "It should teach you that there is\n"
	.string "no end to a TRAINER's chosen path.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_BetterGetBackToGym:: @ 8172B5E
	.string "I'd better get back to PETALBURG GYM.\p"
	.string "MOM, thanks for looking after the house\n"
	.string "while I'm away.$"

PlayersHouse_1F_Text_DadShouldStayLonger:: @ 8172BBC
	.string "MOM: That DAD of yours...\p"
	.string "He comes home for the first time in a\n"
	.string "while, but all he talks about is DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "He should relax and stay a little longer.$"

UnknownString_8172C50: @ 8172C50
	.string "We bring you a special news bulletin.\p"
	.string "We've received reports of a blue FLYING\n"
	.string "DIGIMON in various HOENN locales.\p"
	.string "The identity of this DIGIMON has not\n"
	.string "yet been determined.\p"
	.string "We now return you to your regular\n"
	.string "movie presentation.$"

UnknownString_8172D30: @ 8172D30
	.string "We bring you a special news bulletin.\p"
	.string "We've received reports of a red FLYING\n"
	.string "DIGIMON in various HOENN locales.\p"
	.string "The identity of this DIGIMON has not\n"
	.string "yet been determined.\p"
	.string "We now return you to your regular\n"
	.string "movie presentation.$"

UnknownString_8172E0F: @ 8172E0F
	.string "Gau gau!$"
